IF @mode != "generate"
    RETURN "Technical-summary generation was not selected."

USE ../../references/be-human.md AS writing_guidance
USE ../../references/technical-summary.md#summary-content AS summary_rules
USE ../../assets/pr.md AS pr_template

DO Inspect branch and HEAD before reusing earlier code evidence. Resolve the
    requested implementation scope. Return an object with scope and
    scope_is_clear. Wording edits need no code investigation. AS scope_state

IF @scope_state.scope_is_clear == FALSE
    ASK "Which changes or commit range should this technical summary cover?" AS summary_scope

    DO Resolve @summary_scope into a valid implementation scope. Return an
        object with scope and scope_is_clear. AS scope_state

    IF @scope_state.scope_is_clear == FALSE
        RETURN "Technical-summary generation stopped because the scope is unclear."

DO Review relevant local changes or the explicitly identified commit range in
    @scope_state.scope. Follow exact imports or symbols only for material gaps.
    Do not choose a PR target, fetch, require a clean tree, create commits, or
    run tests solely to write prose. Distinguish observed checks from proposed
    verification. Return the evidence and material uncertainty. AS evidence

DO Prepare an in-memory draft using @evidence, @writing_guidance, and
    @summary_rules. For a new file, use a # TICKET-ID heading followed by the
    Description body shape from @pr_template without the PR title or Description
    heading. For an existing file, preserve its layout, accurate notes, and
    unrequested content. Return an object with draft and unrelated_gaps. AS summary_draft

DO Verify the requested content in @summary_draft.draft is supported, complete,
    and placeholder-free while preserving accurate developer judgments.

DO Read the first heading from @ticket_path and return only its ticket ID. AS current_ticket_id

IF @current_ticket_id != @ticket_id
    RETURN "Technical-summary generation stopped because the active ticket changed."

DO Save @summary_draft.draft only to @summary_path and verify it once.

PRINT Report @summary_path, @evidence, and @summary_draft.unrelated_gaps briefly.
